cc-trait-milkable-name = Milkable
cc-trait-milkable-desc = Your breasts are larger than normal and are capable of producing milk year-round.

cc-trait-egglaying-name = Egg Layer
cc-trait-egglaying-desc = Through surgery or specie preference, you are capable of producing and laying eggs at a moments notice.

# Claw Command - trait categories
trait-category-physical = Physical

# Claw Command - Physical traits
trait-tenacity-name = Tenacity
trait-tenacity-desc = You are hardier than others. Your damage threshold for becoming critical is increased by 5 points.

trait-will-to-live-name = Will To Live
trait-will-to-live-desc = You have an unusually strong will to live. Your damage threshold for becoming dead is increased by 10 points.

trait-vigor-name = Vigor
trait-vigor-desc = Your endurance is enhanced. Your stamina is increased by 10 points.

trait-heavyweight-drunk-name = Alcohol Tolerance
trait-heavyweight-drunk-desc = Your body has developed a high level of alcohol tolerance. The visual effects of intoxication are considerably less noticeable.

trait-thieving-name = Thieving
trait-thieving-desc = You are deft with your hands and talented at convincing people of their belongings. You can steal items quieter and faster.

trait-trap-avoider-name = Trap Avoider
trait-trap-avoider-desc = You are careful where you step. You are immune to preventable step triggers such as mouse traps.

trait-steadfast-name = Steadfast
trait-steadfast-desc = You push through the pain. You resist being slowed down by injuries better than others.

trait-temperature-tolerance-name = Temperature Tolerance
trait-temperature-tolerance-desc = You are more resistant to extreme temperatures, shrugging off heat and cold that would bother others.

trait-light-step-name = Light Step
trait-light-step-desc = You move with a gentle step, making your footsteps quieter.

trait-glass-jaw-name = Glass Jaw
trait-glass-jaw-desc = Your body is more fragile than others. Your damage threshold for becoming critical is decreased by 10 points.

trait-will-to-die-name = Will To Die
trait-will-to-die-desc = You have an unusually weak will to live. Your damage threshold for becoming dead is decreased by 15 points.

trait-lethargy-name = Lethargy
trait-lethargy-desc = You become tired faster than others. Your stamina is decreased by 15 points.

trait-sluggish-name = Sluggish
trait-sluggish-desc = You navigate the world slower than others. Your movement speed is decreased by 16%.

trait-snailpaced-name = Snail-Paced
trait-snailpaced-desc = You walk at a snail's pace. Your movement speed is decreased by 32%.

trait-clumsy-name = Clumsy
trait-clumsy-desc = You are clumsy and prone to accidents. You may fumble with guns, hyposprays, and other equipment.

trait-feeble-name = Feeble
trait-feeble-desc = Your body gives out quickly under stress. Injuries slow you down much more than others.

trait-brittle-bone-name = Osteogenesis Imperfecta
trait-brittle-bone-desc = Also known as "brittle bone disease". Your threshold for critical injury is reduced by 50 points.

trait-redshirt-name = Redshirt
trait-redshirt-desc = Your death threshold is reduced by 100. This means you likely WILL NOT have a critical state.

# Claw Command - accent traits
trait-french-name = French accent
trait-french-desc = Your accent seems to have a certain «je ne sais quoi».

trait-cowboy-name = Cowboy accent
trait-cowboy-desc = You speak with a distinct cowboy accent!

trait-spanish-name = Spanish accent
trait-spanish-desc = Hola señor, donde esta la biblioteca.

trait-italian-name = Italian accent
trait-italian-desc = Mamma mia! You seem to have lived in space Italy!

trait-german-name = German accent
trait-german-desc = You seem to come from space Germany.

# Claw Command - Subdermal armor and platelet traits
trait-dermal-armor-name = Subdermal Armor
trait-dermal-armor-desc = Your skin contains an array of nanoweave layers embedded beneath the surface, engineered as a cost-effective solution for integrated protection that maintains full flexibility. This augmentation provides 1.5 points of flat reduction from all physical damage.

trait-heavy-dermal-armor-name = Heavy Subdermal Armor
trait-heavy-dermal-armor-desc = Your skin contains an advanced composite lattice embedded beneath the surface, engineered to reduce physical trauma to the body without compromising flexibility. This augmentation provides 3 points of flat reduction from all physical damage.

trait-platelet-factories-name = Platelet Factories
trait-platelet-factories-desc = Your body has been augmented with a series of biotailored organs that enhance the owner's long term survivability. These organs will attempt to keep the user alive, even in the face of advanced trauma, all the way up until - but not including - death. Your natural healing is no longer capped, and will now slowly heal any damage type. This includes more exotic injuries like radiation exposure, or cancer.

examine-dermal-armor-message = {CAPITALIZE(POSS-ADJ($entity))} skin has distinct, geometric lines.
examine-heavy-dermal-armor-message = {CAPITALIZE(POSS-ADJ($entity))} skin has distinct, geometric lines with a subtle metallic sheen.

